                 <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
               </button>
             </h2>
             <div class="details" id="answer-sleep" aria-labelledby="question-sleep">
               <p>
                 Most adult cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day, and kittens or senior cats may sleep even more. Short
                 bursts of play before meals can help match their natural hunt-eat-rest rhythm.
               </p>
